  "description": "Donut Crumbles is a cute bubble font inspired by sweet donuts, colorful bakeries, and joyful moments. Featuring thick, rounded letters with a soft and friendly feel, this font delivers a fun and eye-catching personality. Perfect for food branding, bakery packaging, café menus, kids designs, posters, stickers, quotes, and social media content. Donut Crumbles brings a playful charm that feels bold yet approachable, making your designs look cheerful and delicious. Suitable for both digital and print projects, this font is easy to read while still standing out. Add a sprinkle of sweetness and fun to your creative work with Donut Crumbles.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Donut Crumbles is a cute bubble font inspired by sweet donuts, colorful bakeries, and joyful moments. Featuring thick, rounded letters with a soft and friendly feel, this font delivers a fun and eye-catching personality. Perfect for food branding, bakery packaging, café menus, kids designs, posters, stickers, quotes, and social media content. Donut Crumbles brings a playful charm that feels bold yet approachable, making your designs look cheerful and delicious. Suitable for both digital and print projects, this font is easy to read while still standing out. Add a sprinkle of sweetness and fun to your creative work with Donut Crumbles.</p>",
